Error [E0371]: A binding fence needs plain names separated by commas
  --> tests/ui/fenced_name_binding_nonname.jet:2:8
    |
  2 |     @[ f(x), g ]@ :: 1
    |        ^^^^
 Why: A binding fence takes plain names or one ascending numbered-name range; an expression fence takes comma-separated expressions
 Fix: Fix this entry, e.g. `@[ a, b ]@` or `@[ t1..t8 ]@`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0371
